dialog show @s {"type":"minecraft:notice","title":{"text":"Coach Cockle","color":"red"},"body":[{"type":"minecraft:plain_message","contents":{"text":"1. Tap Play Clam Bop! and wait for GO.\n2. Clams in the floor pop open: they glow pink.\n3. Tap an open clam before it shuts (on PC, click it): that's a bop!\n4. You have 30 seconds, and it gets faster at the end.\n\nEveryone in the coconut can play at once. 10 bops win 2 Sand Dollars (once a day). Your best goes on the TOP BOPPERS board."}}],"action":{"label":"Got it!"}}
